{"src":"de","tgt":"en","rate":24000,"room_opened_ms_before":1500,"err":"","clip_ms":198400,"events":[{"kind":"hello","type":"hello","lang":"en","src":"de","rate":24000,"mode":"utterance","edition":"nonprofit","context":true},{"kind":"input","t":11794.283018999999,"text":"Im Jahr 1990 wurde es aufgrund der Bedrohung durch Wüstensand zur Liste der gefährdeten Weltkulturerbegebiete hinzugefügt."},{"kind":"text","t":12191.690841,"text":"In 1990, it was added to the list of endangered World Heritage sites due to the threat from desert sand."},{"kind":"audio","t":12245.928796,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":430,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":12247.791657000002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":12249.023658999999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":12250.326828000001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1220},{"kind":"audio","t":12252.089849,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":210,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":12253.744917,"samples":32360,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":770},{"kind":"input","t":18591.133781,"text":"Wenn Sie den Film Das Vermächtnis der Tempelritter gesehen haben, denken Sie vielleicht, dass es ein Film ist, das Sie nicht sehen."},{"kind":"text","t":18954.203987,"text":"If you’ve seen the movie “The Templars,” you might think it’s a film you shouldn’t watch."},{"kind":"audio","t":19003.203046,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":410,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":19004.76199,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":950},{"kind":"audio","t":19006.545541,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":40,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":19008.032988,"samples":29496,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":710},{"kind":"input","t":20970.230584,"text":"dass auf der Rückseite der Unabhängigkeitserklärung eine Schatzkarte gezeichnet wurde."},{"kind":"text","t":21217.010770999997,"text":"that a treasure map was drawn on the back of the Declaration of Independence."},{"kind":"audio","t":21261.554711999997,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":430,"off":1320},{"kind":"audio","t":21263.251182,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":330,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":21264.778168,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":50,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":21266.21621,"samples":30696,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":730},{"kind":"input","t":31339.483251,"text":"Kinder werden aus einer Vielzahl von Gründen in Pflegefamilien untergebracht, und zwar aus verschiedenen Gründen."},{"kind":"text","t":31547.418264999997,"text":"Children are placed in foster families for a variety of reasons."},{"kind":"audio","t":31590.530863999997,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":400,"off":1330},{"kind":"audio","t":31592.068194999996,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":10,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":31593.783854999998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":300,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":31594.676847,"samples":22296,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":370},{"kind":"input","t":32928.53846,"text":"die von Vernachlässigung über Missbrauch bis hin zur Erpressung reichen."},{"kind":"text","t":33104.102736,"text":"ranging from neglect to abuse to extortion."},{"kind":"audio","t":33145.008958000006,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":410,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":33146.863626000006,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":33147.501095,"samples":20864,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":280},{"kind":"input","t":42727.016965,"text":"Das Cochamotal Chiles wichtigstes Kletterziel, bekannt als der Yosemite National Park von Südamerika mit einer Vielzahl von großen Granitwänden und Klippen."},{"kind":"text","t":43213.791687000004,"text":"Cochamó Tal is Chile’s most important climbing destination, known as South America’s Yosemite National Park, with a multitude of large granite walls and cliffs."},{"kind":"audio","t":43269.82441,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":390,"off":1350},{"kind":"audio","t":43271.329633,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":160,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":43273.124802000006,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":43274.84584,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":43276.699256,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":43278.464721000004,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":970},{"kind":"audio","t":43280.335253000005,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":70,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":43282.13582,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":43283.410797000004,"samples":27056,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":530},{"kind":"input","t":52975.392556000006,"text":"Aristoteles Ansichten zu allen Wissenschaftsfragen einschließlich der Psychologie waren anerkannt."},{"kind":"text","t":53235.063624,"text":"Aristotle’s views on all scientific matters, including psychology, were recognized."},{"kind":"audio","t":53280.956052,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":410,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":53282.189607,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":53283.889252,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":53285.608307,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":30,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":53286.889503000006,"samples":26728,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":570},{"kind":"input","t":58204.839461,"text":"Wenn Sie es nicht gewohnt sind, auf Landstraßen zu fahren, bleiben Sie achtsam. Steiles Gefälle, enge Fahrbahnen und scharfe Kurven überwiegen nicht."},{"kind":"text","t":58451.355271,"text":"If you’re not used to driving on country roads, stay cautious. Steep slopes, narrow roads, and sharp turns are not prevalent."},{"kind":"audio","t":58496.162567,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":410,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":58497.757155,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1310},{"kind":"audio","t":58499.543560000006,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":230,"off":1210},{"kind":"audio","t":58499.738153000006,"samples":9696,"rate":24000},{"kind":"audio","t":58539.965944,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":370,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":58541.444347000004,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":58543.176621000006,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1060},{"kind":"audio","t":58543.357423,"samples":8496,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":67273.870782,"text":"Die Gegenwart eines echten, unsichtbaren Teams, Larson und Lafasto, 1989, Seite 119."},{"kind":"text","t":67679.57917299999,"text":"The presence of a real, invisible team, Larson and Lafasto, 1989, page 119."},{"kind":"audio","t":67728.60227799999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":390,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":67730.527122,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1320},{"kind":"audio","t":67731.90315099999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":310,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":67733.714184,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":67735.445216,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":67737.384452,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":890},{"kind":"audio","t":67737.52060599999,"samples":4392,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":72321.26523599999,"text":"209 ist auch ein einzigartiger Bestandteil eines virtuellen Teams."},{"kind":"text","t":72542.425815,"text":"209 is also a unique component of a virtual team."},{"kind":"audio","t":72585.46291,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":380,"off":1330},{"kind":"audio","t":72586.906771,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":350,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":72588.706557,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":100,"off":1350},{"kind":"audio","t":72589.888914,"samples":25896,"rate":24000,"on":30,"off":430},{"kind":"input","t":84758.532725,"text":"Nach dem Unfall wurde Gibson in ein Krankenhaus gebracht. Er verstarb jedoch kurz darauf."},{"kind":"text","t":84995.584085,"text":"After the accident, Gibson was taken to a hospital. He passed away shortly thereafter."},{"kind":"audio","t":85040.293364,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":400,"off":1350},{"kind":"audio","t":85042.160431,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":330,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":85043.518142,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":890},{"kind":"audio","t":85043.676601,"samples":2496,"rate":24000},{"kind":"audio","t":85076.338036,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":410,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":85077.796709,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":980},{"kind":"audio","t":85077.97529799999,"samples":4664,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":94637.05127699999,"text":"Viele deutsche Backwaren beinhalten außerdem Mandeln, Haselnüsse oder andere Nüsse. Beliebte Kuchen passen häufig besonders gut zu einer Tasse starken Kaffees."},{"kind":"text","t":94958.366645,"text":"Many German baked goods also contain almonds, hazelnuts, or other nuts. Popular cakes often pair especially well with a cup of strong coffee."},{"kind":"audio","t":95005.63454099999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":420,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":95007.088047,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":95008.788093,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":95010.65261599999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1020},{"kind":"audio","t":95010.78727799999,"samples":3928,"rate":24000},{"kind":"audio","t":95045.317403,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":400,"off":1270},{"kind":"audio","t":95046.910559,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":180,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":95048.60377399999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":95049.843939,"samples":27696,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":550},{"kind":"input","t":100636.75409999999,"text":"Wenn man eine romanische Sprache spricht, ist es natürlich leichter, Portugiesisch zu erlernen."},{"kind":"text","t":100883.819235,"text":"If one speaks a Romance language, it’s naturally easier to learn Portuguese."},{"kind":"audio","t":100928.72126399999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":410,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":100930.11055299999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1020},{"kind":"audio","t":100931.877469,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":80,"off":1340},{"kind":"audio","t":100933.73369,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1120},{"kind":"audio","t":100933.871888,"samples":7528,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":111050.338047,"text":"Die Klang- und Lichtshow bei den Pyramiden ist eine der interessantesten Attraktionen für Kinder in der Gegend."},{"kind":"text","t":111397.54233899999,"text":"The sound and light show at the pyramids is one of the most interesting attractions for children in the area."},{"kind":"audio","t":111445.447944,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":390,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":111447.002681,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":111448.64323799999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":430,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":111450.46526699999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1350},{"kind":"audio","t":111452.240777,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":10,"off":1230},{"kind":"audio","t":111452.533287,"samples":11960,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":117801.330733,"text":"Verkehrsfluss ist die Untersuchung der Bewegung einzelner Fahrer und Fahrzeuge zwischen zwei Punkten und der Interaktion zwischen den Fahrzeugen."},{"kind":"text","t":118161.509502,"text":"Traffic flow is the study of the movement of individual drivers and vehicles between two points and the interaction between those vehicles."},{"kind":"audio","t":118213.808161,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":380,"off":1200},{"kind":"audio","t":118215.348848,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":70,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":118217.063987,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":118218.838104,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":118220.53890099999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":990},{"kind":"audio","t":118222.37181699999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":60,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":118224.224072,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":910},{"kind":"audio","t":118224.359595,"samples":2824,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":119572.973678,"text":"die zwischen beiden stattfinden."},{"kind":"text","t":119721.07211,"text":"those that occur between the two points."},{"kind":"audio","t":119762.267346,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":390,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":119763.839079,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":950},{"kind":"audio","t":119764.00781299999,"samples":2864,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":129334.408188,"text":"Der Australier Mitchell Gurley wurde 11. im stehenden Super G der Männer. Der tschechische Konkurrent Aldrich Jelinek wurde 16. im sitzenden Super G der Männer."},{"kind":"text","t":129670.641705,"text":"Australian Mitchell Gurley became number 11. the men's standing Super G. The Czech competitor Aldrich Jelinek finished in 16th place. Men's sitting Super G."},{"kind":"audio","t":129718.49033399999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":410,"off":1350},{"kind":"audio","t":129719.87120000001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":250,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":129721.065987,"samples":26864,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":490},{"kind":"audio","t":129762.06237399999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":380,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":129763.406925,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":129765.170727,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":129766.986617,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":129768.61218099999,"samples":32728,"rate":24000,"on":50,"off":790},{"kind":"audio","t":129797.74622300001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":390,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":129798.36862899999,"samples":23032,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":420},{"kind":"input","t":139717.42337600002,"text":"Das Haitianische Institut für Gerechtigkeit und Demokratie hat auf unabhängigen Studien verwiesen, die nahelegen, dass die Menschen in der Welt, die wir hier leben,"},{"kind":"text","t":140040.98102600002,"text":"The Haitian Institute for Justice and Democracy cited independent studies suggesting that people in the world we live in"},{"kind":"audio","t":140091.428863,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":400,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":140093.004061,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":140094.664488,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":140096.445966,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1120},{"kind":"audio","t":140098.31791,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":150,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":140099.99662400002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1270},{"kind":"audio","t":140100.35971000002,"samples":12792,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":142173.67840600002,"text":"dass das nepalesische UN-Friedensbataillon die Krankheit unwissentlich nach Haiti eingeschleppt hat."},{"kind":"text","t":142433.51079700002,"text":"that the Nepalese UN peacekeeping battalion inadvertently brought the disease to Haiti."},{"kind":"audio","t":142479.511678,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":420,"off":1350},{"kind":"audio","t":142481.036851,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":80,"off":1350},{"kind":"audio","t":142482.680081,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":10,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":142484.47395800002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":142485.651388,"samples":25528,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":430},{"kind":"input","t":152511.37745300002,"text":"Bald nach dem Ausbruch von Kampfhandlungen initiierte Großbritannien eine Seeblockade gegen Deutschland. Er griff auch alles an, was ins Wasser kam."},{"kind":"text","t":152836.111321,"text":"Shortly after the outbreak of hostilities, Britain imposed a naval blockade on Germany. He also attacked everything that went into the water."},{"kind":"audio","t":152882.065662,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":380,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":152883.462322,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1330},{"kind":"audio","t":152885.17880300002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":410,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":152887.00507800002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":152888.280055,"samples":26128,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":450},{"kind":"audio","t":152921.23614400002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":400,"off":1340},{"kind":"audio","t":152922.826825,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":20,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":152924.108282,"samples":28064,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":560},{"kind":"input","t":156019.03495200002,"text":"Selbst ein großer Dinosaurier wie der T-Rex war ihm nicht gewachsen."},{"kind":"text","t":156250.53749800002,"text":"Not even a giant dinosaur like the T-Rex could match him."},{"kind":"audio","t":156294.14203000002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":430,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":156295.660012,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":156297.497023,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":960},{"kind":"audio","t":156297.618376,"samples":5496,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":166492.99929500002,"text":"Die Verwendung von Videoaufzeichnungen führte zu wichtigen Erkenntnissen für die Deutung von Mikroexpressionen, wenige Millisekunden dauernden"},{"kind":"text","t":166823.631353,"text":"The use of video recordings led to important insights for interpreting microexpressions that last just a few milliseconds."},{"kind":"audio","t":166873.029264,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":390,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":166874.328757,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":166876.059138,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":166877.826955,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1300},{"kind":"audio","t":166879.551517,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":10,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":166881.374738,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":166882.16803,"samples":19392,"rate":24000,"on":120,"off":220},{"kind":"input","t":175790.607507,"text":"Die Ankündigung erfolgte nach einem Telefongespräch von Trump mit dem türkischen Präsidenten Recep Tayyip Erdogan."},{"kind":"text","t":176096.722003,"text":"The announcement came after a phone call between Trump and Turkish President Recep Tayyip Erdogan."},{"kind":"audio","t":176143.766195,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":410,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":176145.348023,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":176147.12021700002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":176150.15974600002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":176151.55263000002,"samples":32728,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":750},{"kind":"input","t":184401.046364,"text":"Tayyip Erdogan Es gibt Familienstrände, die manchmal überlaufen sind, mit einer schönen Einkaufspromenade entlang der Küste"},{"kind":"text","t":184720.08698000002,"text":"There are family beaches that can be crowded at times, with a nice promenade along the coast."},{"kind":"audio","t":184764.542311,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":400,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":184766.42328800002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":20,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":184768.396614,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":184770.17959400002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":184771.06173000002,"samples":21928,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":350},{"kind":"input","t":193517.370606,"text":"Das Schwimmen ist hier sicher."},{"kind":"text","t":193638.29791400002,"text":"Swimming is safe here."},{"kind":"audio","t":193678.827204,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":370,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":193679.052903,"samples":17032,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":190},{"kind":"input","t":198623.664217,"text":"und als luxuriöse Seebäder bekannt."},{"kind":"text","t":198769.55625000002,"text":"and are known as luxurious seaside resorts."},{"kind":"audio","t":198808.793298,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":410,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":198810.61686900002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1260},{"kind":"audio","t":198811.097681,"samples":15464,"rate":24000,"on":0,"o